        "original_id": "72b98b56-5ab5-5766-8d7c-80318dbba13c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Seton Hall Pirates men's basketball team, New Jersey Devils, Big East Conference, National Hockey League, Seton Hall University, WWE\n- People: Kevin Willard\n- Places: Prudential Center, Newark, New Jersey\n- Events: 2012–13 Seton Hall Pirates men's basketball season, Extreme Rules (2016)\n\nFacts:\n- Prudential Center opened in 2007 in Newark, New Jersey.\n- Prudential Center is the home arena of the New Jersey Devils of the National Hockey League.\n- Prudential Center is the home venue of the Seton Hall Pirates men's basketball team from Seton Hall University.\n- During the 2012–13 season, Kevin Willard was the head coach of the Seton Hall Pirates men's basketball team.\n- During the 2012–13 season, the Seton Hall Pirates men's basketball team played its home games at Prudential Center in Newark, New Jersey.\n- During the 2012–13 season, the Seton Hall Pirates men's basketball team were members of the Big East Conference.\n- Extreme Rules (2016) took place on May 22, 2016, at Prudential Center in Newark, New Jersey.",
